{"id":"reference/WebAssembly","kind":"langref","title":"WebAssembly","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#WebAssembly","file":"reference/WebAssembly.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"WebAssembly","text":"WebAssembly"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Freestanding","text":"独立环境"},{"depth":3,"slug":"WASI","text":"WASI"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"WebAssembly\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/WebAssembly/#WebAssembly\">WebAssembly</a></h2>\n\n      <p>Zig 原生支持构建面向 WebAssembly 的程序。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Freestanding\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/WebAssembly/#Freestanding\">独立环境</a></h3>\n\n      <p>对于浏览器、nodejs 等宿主环境，使用独立环境操作系统目标构建可执行文件。以下示例使用 nodejs 运行编译为 WebAssembly 的 Zig 代码。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">math.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">add</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    print(a + b);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe math.zig -target wasm32-freestanding -fno-entry --export=add</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"javascript-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test.js</cite></figcaption><pre><code>const fs = require('fs');\nconst source = fs.readFileSync(\"./math.wasm\");\nconst typedArray = new Uint8Array(source);\n\nWebAssembly.instantiate(typedArray, {\n  env: {\n    print: (result) =&gt; { console.log(`The result is ${result}`); }\n  }}).then(result =&gt; {\n  const add = result.instance.exports.add;\n  add(1, 2);\n});</code></pre></figure>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>node test.js</kbd>\nThe result is 3\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"WASI\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/WebAssembly/#WASI\">WASI</a></h3>\n\n      <p>Zig 标准库对 WebAssembly 系统接口提供一等支持。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">wasi_args.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>(init: std.process.Init) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> args = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> init.minimal.args.toSlice(init.arena.allocator());\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>.., args) |i, arg| {\n        std.debug.print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}: {s}\\n\"</span>, .{ i, arg });\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe wasi_args.zig -target wasm32-wasi</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>wasmtime wasi_args.wasm 123 hello</kbd>\n0: wasi_args.wasm\n1: 123\n2: hello\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <p>更有趣的例子是从运行时提取预打开目录列表。目前标准库通过 <code>std.fs.wasi.Preopens</code> 支持此功能：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">wasi_preopens.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>(init: std.process.Init) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (init.preopens.map.keys(), <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..) |preopen, i| {\n        std.log.info(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"{d}: {s}\"</span>, .{ i, preopen });\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe wasi_preopens.zig -target wasm32-wasi</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>wasmtime --dir=. wasi_preopens.wasm</kbd>\n0: stdin\n1: stdout\n2: stderr\n3: .\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":13,"translated":13}}
